    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "learningObjectives": {
      "en": [
        "Explain the core decision rules behind writing objective entry rules that can be audited.",
        "Apply writing objective entry rules that can be audited to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释制定可审核的客观入场规则背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将制定可审核的客观入场规则应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
    },
